      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "3.1.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.1.2",
        "fileName": "MoECalculator_3.1.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T10:46:02.618Z",
        "changeLog": "Vertical orientation for both centre-screen in-battle bars (Moving Average and Damage Efficiency) — draw them horizontally, or vertically beside the minimap.\nFixed / Free alignment with a position lock. Fixed snaps the bar to a built-in spot chosen by orientation; Free unlocks Ctrl+drag and the numeric X/Y fields. Orientation, alignment, and position now set each other automatically.\nPer-vehicle mode override with a rebindable toggle hotkey (default K) — flip the progress bar's mode for the current tank; the mod remembers your choice per vehicle. An Automatic Mode Toggle threshold can flip it for you once a tank's pre-battle mark progress crosses a set percent.\nWidget previews inside the settings panel — see both in-battle widgets rendered right in the ModsSettingsAPI menu.\nA reworked ETA-in-battles readout on the vertical bars."
      }
    },
